 "meta": {
  "title": "Shapes \u2014 YOLO-style Detector from Blocks",
  "description": "A detector you can read end to end: five strided convolution stages, an FPN neck that fuses the stride 8 / 16 / 32 features and an anchor-free YOLO-style head trained with the GIoU box loss. Trains from scratch in minutes on generated shapes; swap Synthetic Shapes for a COCO or YOLO dataset to detect your own objects."
 },
